// Description: F-Secure C3 produces DLLs with a default exported StartNodeRelay function.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.command_line like "*_rundll32.exe*" and process.command_line like "*_.dll*" and process.command_line like "*_StartNodeRelay*"))
